 "source_notes": [
  "Source: ChatGPT concept sheet 'LONG LINES / FACTORY V1 ASSET PACKAGE - 1970s COUCH (SOFA)'. Its maps are 1/3-size panels inside one image and not to scale; panels are resampled to 160 px/m here.",
  "Proportions from the painted front/side/rear views (arms 17 cm, cushions 55 cm); the sheet's JSON excerpt said 62 cm cushions, which would leave 6 cm arms.",
  "Faces the sheet does not paint (cushion sides/backs/bottoms, hidden frame faces) reuse fabric from the nearest painted panel.",
  "The orthographic views are resampled to the declared size; the sheet's top view was about 30% short."
 ],
 "assembly_notes": [
  "Back is vertical: the side views show it raked, and V1 has no rotation yet.",
  "Not built: tufting buttons (painted on the back cushions; only 4 of 6 painted as parts), tapered legs (cylinders), the draped blanket (no cloth construction).",
  "Seat base front set 1 cm behind the arm fronts (flush faces z-fight)."
 ]
